  abstract={This is 2nd workshop on Ubiquitous and Multi-domain User Modeling (UMUM-23), held in conjunction with PerCom 2023. This workshop aims to explore a new line of research to build ubiquitous and multi-domain user models and increase their applicability in real-world contexts, e.g., activity recognition and context/activity-aware services. In UMUM-23, 1 keynote talk, 1 opening talk and 7 oral presentations will be provided. We look forward to meeting you all.},
